### 1. GET - Mengambil semua transaksi
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions
Accept: application/json


### 2. POST - Menambahkan transaksi
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Makan siang",
  "amount": 25000,
  "category": "expense",
  "category_name": "Makanan",
  "transaction_date": "2026-11-15"
}

### 3. GET - Mengambil semua transaksi
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions
Accept: application/json


### 4. GET - Mengambil transaksi berdasarkan ID
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions/ID_TRANSAKSI
Accept: application/json

### 5. POST - Menguji transaksi duplikat
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Makan siang",
  "amount": 25000,
  "category": "expense",
  "category_name": "Makanan",
  "transaction_date": "2026-11-15"
}

### 6. PATCH - Mengubah transaksi
PATCH http://localhost:3000/transactions/ID_TRANSAKSI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Makan siang di kampus",
  "amount": 30000
}

### 7. GET - Memeriksa hasil perubahan
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions/ID_TRANSAKSI
Accept: application/json


### 8. DELETE - Menghapus transaksi
DELETE http://localhost:3000/transactions/ID_TRANSAKSI


### 9. GET - Menguji transaksi yang sudah dihapus
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions/ID_TRANSAKSI
Accept: application/json


### 10. POST - Menguji validasi data
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "AB",
  "amount": 0,
  "category": "transfer",
  "category_name": "Makanan",
  "transaction_date": "15-11-2026"
}
